{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S04、S11等段的感受提示仍然偏密，部分比喻和联想稍显用力，容易短暂分走听音乐的注意力；Y的留白和简洁感更好。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然话和感受的条目更多，但短句拆分、关键词加亮和感受字级的区分，让我能迅速抓住每段在讲什么，也更容易看清人物为什么从靠近、克制、担忧走到坦然接受。尤其感受按音乐节点出现，不必一次面对整堆词，音乐变化和心理变化之间的对应关系更清楚；从S01到S14，前面的害怕失去、中途的反复确认、最后的不再隐藏，也形成了比较完整的情绪发展。Y的左右分栏有直观优势，但右侧短词较容易变成一组组独立的情绪标签，具体感受不少，彼此之间的变化关系却不如X清晰。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "401f5de0-5aef-44b5-adaf-eb50a08bb6bc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T205035273871Z", "elapsed_seconds": 67.078, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T20:51:42.363132+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1c2f3ad42a83b470c2d4fa77de4b95e37bb3bc43dc749219b72c5970c908ae2f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33c